<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
        Hardened Runtime entitlements for the notarized Developer ID build:
        deliberately none. The embedded llama.cpp runtime (Metal + Accelerate)
        maps no JIT or writable-executable pages in our process — Metal shader
        compilation happens in the GPU driver's process — so
        `cs.allow-jit` and `cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory` are not
        needed. Verified 2026-10-01 on a release build (llama-cpp-sys-2
        0.1.158): a binary signed with `--options runtime` and no entitlements
        completed an embedded-model chat turn. `make verify-mac` fails if a
        Hardened Runtime exception entitlement comes back (CASA/DASA 3.3.2).
    -->
</dict>
</plist>
